WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.000
Narrator: Now Noura walks it.

2
00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:13.300
Narrator: At every stop she looks, points and says it out loud: the nearest exit, first aid, the assembly point and the emergency vehicle route.

3
00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:24.300
Noura: Nearest exit - Gate 3, forty metres, that way.

4
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:28.800
Noura: First aid - next to the Info Point, Gate 5.

5
00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:32.900
Noura: Assembly point - car park B, across the crossing.

6
00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:37.000
Noura: Emergency vehicle route - this lane. Keep it clear.

7
00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:44.700
Narrator: Saying it out loud helps you remember it under pressure.

8
00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:52.900
Narrator: She also walks the route a fan would walk - from the crossing, through the queue, to the gate.

